	(text "J1/J2: S3 board (ESP32-S3FH4R2), top view with USB-C up. J1 = left row, J2 = right row, rows 15.24mm apart." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2cb2b7df-1e88-4745-a13f-0190318d21f7"))
	(text "J3: FFC 12P adapter (2x6). Pad k = adapter print k = trackpad J1 pin (13-k). Pad 1 = VDD(3V3), pad 12 = SCK.\nInsert the adapter with its printed 1 on the square pad. Before power-on, check pad 1 <-> trackpad VDD continuity." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c87d83af-bae1-4b5a-884d-3c03eb5ba942"))
	(text "J4: Akizuki AE-CH9102F-TYPEC-BO, 2x4 (component side up). Odd = CN3: 1 RxD, 3 TxD(NC: 5V output), 5 GND, 7 +5V.\nEven = CN2 (unused): 2 VIO, 4 DTR, 6 RTS, 8 CTS." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1aa48b51-9210-458b-a1ef-3af80f4d8f90"))
	(text "SW1/SW2: MX hot-swap between GPIO and GND (internal pull-up). SW1 = GPIO6, SW2 = GPIO7 (firmware support needed).\nNo 5V jumper: unplug CH9102F before connecting the S3 USB-C to a PC." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 40.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4b520e3e-15df-43da-a3ef-91eafd7dcf4f"))
